<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Diario Official do Estado de São Paulo — 1 de Abril de 1910</title>
<style>
    body {
        background: #ffffff;
        color: #000;
        font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px 30px;
        max-width: 1000px;
    }

    .masthead {
        text-align: center;
    }

    .masthead .linha1 {
        font-family: "Arial Black", Impact, sans-serif;
        font-weight: bold;
